        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Springfield Stealing - I",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ELEGANT_LLAMA",
        "PublicId": "131856647006",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository eb9793fd-4f4a-4181-aca9-b304beed659e).Image",
        "Description": "47, recently a heist occurred at the Smith &amp; Wesson firearms museum in Springfield, Massachusetts. Several firearms have been stolen, and they’ve been sold to the highest bidders. We’ve located them, however, each has been bought by people whose houses look like Fort Knox. We need to clear a path in order to retrieve the weapons, and so, you need to eliminate the first buyer, Tommy Hamitlon. Him and his friends happen to be at the party in Mendoza today. Eliminate them. Good luck.",
